<title>USA: New Horizons Q4 net profit after loss.</title>
<headline>New Horizons Q4 net profit after loss.</headline>
<dateline>MORGANVILLE, N.J. 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.03     loss	 $0.03</p>
<p> Net profit		   181     loss	   194</p>
<p> Revs			11,691		    6,979</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   6,923		    6,865</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.96     loss	 $0.03</p>
<p> Net loss		   6,635     loss	   193</p>
<p> Revs			41,269		   23,733</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   6,882		    6,865</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Full name of company is New Horizons Worldwide Inc.</p>
<p>Excluding non-recurring charges, 1996 Q4 net profit was $798,000, or $0.12 per share, compared to a loss from continuing operations of $600,000, or $0.09 per share, for full-year 1995.</p>
</text>
